This product includes data derived from the Arlington PDF Model
(https://github.com/pdf-association/arlington-pdf-model), commit
c48b363e9b78902deea03e958693c09339248a3a: the object tables of
src/AdCodicem.Pdf/Validation/Arlington/ArlingtonModel.g.cs, compiled into the
AdCodicem.Pdf assembly. They were generated from the model's TSV files, and
changed: reduced to lookup tables and overridden as
tools/AdCodicem.Pdf.Arlington/overrides.tsv records. The model's own files are
vendored unmodified in tools/AdCodicem.Pdf.Arlington/model/.

